      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹9.28 (vs ₹10.39 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹9.28 (down from ₹10.39 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹146.7m (up 11% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹44.5m (down 11% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 30% (down from 38% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 10% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
